(Stung Treng): Mr. Sor Soputra, Governor of Stung Treng Province, and his team and relevant departments and units, accompanied by Mrs. Chairman of District Council, District Governor and Commune Chief on the afternoon of July 17, 2024, inspected the wooden bridge. One concrete head in Orun village, O'Svay commune, Borey O'Svay Senchey district, Stung Treng province, 55 meters long and 3.50 meters wide.
The concrete bridge above the bridge collapsed at the foot of the bridge on the night of July 3, 2024 due to heavy flooding, along with logs and bamboo, flooded the bridge pillars, causing the bridge piers to collapse. With the force of the water flowing during the collapse of the bridge piers, the water level is as high as the bridge board.
