Brigadier General Ly Darith told the people about the weather in Oddar Meanchey province, based on the forecast of the Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology from 17 to 19 July 2024, is affected by low pressure valleys, active thunderstorms. Lightning level from low to high, which is why our people must be careful.
On this occasion, Brigadier General Ly Darith also distributed to the four families, each family received: 50 kg of rice, 2 boxes of fish, 2 sticks of fish sauce and 180,000 Riels and supported her. The commune chief of Phav donated 150,000 riels and 8 village guards 20,000 riels each.
