(Phnom Penh): To prepare for the historic celebration on the opening day of the Funan Techo Prek Chik project for Phnom Penh, there will be a big event on Koh Pich, with the Phnom Penh Capital Hall will hold a concert with about 10,000 participants. Massive fireworks display to celebrate the opening day.
Mr. Khuong Sreng continued that for the night of August 5, we are also preparing for a big event in Koh Pich, a concert with about 10,000 participants with two fireworks. 7:20 a.m. once and at 9: 9 a.m. once again to celebrate the opening day of the Funan Techo canal project.
