(Phnom Penh): Unions and Informal Economy Associations consisting of the Union of Peace Labor Unions, the Association of Informal Entrepreneurs for Peace and the Sokret Press Association have issued a petition in support of the statement made by His Excellency Hun Manet, which does not allow foreign and foreign electric taxis. Neighbors come to do business in Cambodia.
Through the petition in support of the Unions and Informal Economy Association, which was received by Fresh News on the afternoon of July 17, 2024, the Union and the Informal Economy Association expressed their support for the speech of Samdech President Hun Manet via voicemail on July 13, 2024, which Samdech did not allow the issuance of electric taxi licenses of foreigners and neighboring countries to do business in the Kingdom of Cambodia.
Unions and Associations of Informal Economy confirmed through the petition that through the special voice message of His Majesty the King, people all over the Kingdom of Cambodia are very excited, especially business people, motodup drivers, informal economy and taxis. All kinds.
The same source added that the leaders of all members in the capitals and provinces would like to support the noble message of His Excellency Hun Manet, Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia, which has set out the first phase of the National Strategic Strategy of the Pentagon, which always considers The well-being of business people, motorbike taxi drivers, tricycles and informal economy taxis in the Kingdom of Cambodia.
Unions and informal economic associations strongly oppose and condemn a small number of extremist opposition groups who intentionally incite false information to mislead the people, accusing the Royal Government of allowing foreign electric taxis to do business in Cambodia. . Third Plenary Session of the 20th Mandate Central Committee of the Communist Party of China
The third plenary session of the 20th Central Committee of the Communist Party of China (CPC) is being held in Beijing from July 15 to 18. The Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee held a meeting on April 30, deciding to hold the third plenary session of the 20th CPC Central Committee in Beijing in July 2024.
The Plenary Meeting is important in defining top leadership policies and high-level decisions that could lead to a change in order and change the global economy, trade and investment.
China continues to play a key role in orienting the global economy as one of the world's largest suppliers of goods. The direction of the global economy leads to the common destiny of mankind.
The world is expecting this meeting to point out that now and in the future is an important time for a comprehensive push for nation-building and the cause of China's great prosperity. By modernizing in the Chinese style. In the face of new technological revolutions and new industries, as well as the new expectations of the people, we must continue to push reforms forward.
This is a necessary requirement for the adherence and legitimacy of a unique socialist regime, as well as for the modernization of the system and capacity of national governance.
