Minister Tho Chetha Makes Statement at the UN High-Level Political Forum on Sustainable Development 2024
(New York): Minister of Water Resources and Meteorology Tho Chetha on July 15, 2024, led a high-level delegation to attend the United Nations High-Level Political Forum on Sustainable Development 2024 in New York. United States.
Please be informed that during the forum, the Minister made a statement on sustainable development in Cambodia under the theme Agenda 2030 for sustainable development and poverty eradication in times of crisis by providing effective and sustainable solutions. Resilient and innovative and made a statement on the Sixth Sustainable Development Goals on Water and Sanitation (SDG 6) at a special water action program event.
The Minister informed the forum that Cambodia is committed to contributing under the Paris Agreement to the transition to renewable energy, increasing climate resilience and promoting sustainable land and water management. Strengthen global solidarity to address financial, technological and capacity building gaps.
