It should also be noted that according to the report of the Borey Osvay Senchey District Field Team, read by Mr. Svay Putheara, Deputy District Governor in the first half of 2024, some of the overall achievements are mostly in response to the goals and objectives of District development, poverty reduction for the people throughout the district and the provision of more effective public services.
