Dr. Ngov Kang: The Ministry of Health supports the expansion of prosthetics and satellite services in private hospitals, but must provide ethical services
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Ngov Kang, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health, stated that the establishment of artificial limbs and satellites for the disabled at private health services is a task that the Ministry of Health strongly supports. Together, help meet the needs of customers to receive practical services, but must provide services with ethics.
Dr. Ngov Kang said this morning, July 15, 2024, on the occasion of presiding over the inauguration of Exx Central Clinic, artificial limbs and satellites in collaboration with Exit WorldWide and Central Hospital. The event was also attended by Ms. Sim Sovannara, Director General of Central Hospital, Mr. Kheng Chanvichet, Manager of Exx Central Clinic, Prosthetics and Satellites and many other stakeholders.
Dr. Ngov Kang added that through the expansion of prosthetic and satellite services in Exit World Hospital Central Hospital, the Royal Government as well as the Ministry of Health are supporting this service in both the public and private sectors. Private, however, the provision of services must adhere to ethics and professionalism and dignity, respecting the decision of customers to use the services in any health care facility.
Dr. Ngov Kang added that in relation to this disability issue, in the past, Cambodia had a lot of problems related to landmines and war remnants, but so far the Royal Government has made a lot of reductions. And we still come across this disability caused by chronic diseases, which obviously now the Ministry of Health is also very careful to help patients.
Ms. Sim Sovannara also said that Extra-Orthopedic and Orthopedic Clinic will offer a wide range of rehabilitation services, from assessment, diagnosis, and prescribing to prosthetics and orthotics. Manufactured to customer requirements as well. All prostheses and orthotics are manufactured in a mid-level prosthetics and orthotics workshop located in Phnom Penh.
