(Phnom Penh): Mr. Heng Sour, Minister of Labor and Vocational Training, stated that the winners of the 11th National Robot Competition 2024 will be additional human resources and human capital for Cambodia, which is full of capacity, quality, knowledge and skills. Through this national competition.
Human resources recruited through today's capabilities are an important part of contributing to equitable and equitable socio-economic development and being able to transform Cambodia's workforce into a skilled workforce in the future.
This was stated by Mr. Heng Sour, Minister of Labor and Vocational Training on the occasion of presiding over the opening ceremony of the 11th Robot Competition 2024 organized by the General Department of National Television of Cambodia on July 14, 2014 at Moradok Techo Stadium. .
The opening ceremony of the 11th Robot Competition 2024 in the presence of Mr. Neth Pheaktra, Minister of Information, and thousands of students to celebrate the 9 teams of robots from the University, Institute and Digital Technology of Cambodia .
Minister Heng Sour emphasized that human resources with high human capital is a key factor and priority in the development of a strong nation, which all development will not be able to function with quality, efficiency and productivity without human resources. Highly qualified in both hard and soft skills as well as hard work performance in accordance with professional ethics.
Therefore, the purpose of this national robot competition is to provide opportunities for students from various institutes and universities to demonstrate their ability to research and produce robotic technology devices directly to participate in the competition and to find the champion team for the Cambodian representative to compete. International robotics in Vietnam in August 2024.
The Minister said that through many national and international competitions in the past, it has shown that the field of science and technology in Cambodia is not inferior to other countries, Cambodia has been gradually building Human resources that can produce robots and compete internationally.
The theme for this robotic competition is related to agricultural harvesting, which is a demonstration of the robotic automation technology system that Khmer children can produce, which will help the agricultural sector and transform the agricultural sector using automated technology and machinery. More to increase productivity and build the agricultural sector to become a more important national economy in the country.
Mr. Heng Sour instructed all the students who can build a robot, but if they do not know how to unite, do not know how to divide the roles and responsibilities and do not know how to control their emotions during the game, fear of losing control. Therefore, it is necessary to have self-control to achieve results and win the national competition on this occasion to advance to the national competition in Vietnam in August 2024.
Mr. Khim Vuthy, Director General of the National Television of Cambodia, reported that 11 years ago, the General Department of the National Television of Cambodia provided an opportunity for young Cambodians who love technology to meet and exchange ideas and experiences with each other. The development of knowledge, ability and expertise in the field of robotics in the Kingdom of Cambodia from year to year has achieved remarkable results.
Since 2024, the producers of the National Television of Cambodia have led a team of Cambodian robots to participate in regional competitions, attracting the attention of the national and international community, and in subsequent years, although the Cambodian students did not get good grades, but the results are It should be satisfactory for Cambodia until Cambodia has the ability to host the regional robot competition in 2023.
