(Kampong Chhnang): The Kampong Chhnang Provincial Administration has been making plans to local authorities and inspiring people in all eight districts to increase tree planting activities in all areas, especially in the flooded forest area. Of past devastation.
In fact, on the morning of July 12, 2024, the Chulkiri District Administration organized a planting ceremony of flooded forest trees in its area, led by government officials, the Armed Forces, students and people planted more than 2 flooded forest trees. 000 trees, which are species of trees planted in the area of Boeung Rong Sdey Kong Toch in Kbal Konlong and Peam Chkork villages in Peam Chkork commune.
The planting of flooded forest in Chulkiri district above, with the participation of Mr. San You, Deputy Governor of Kampong Chhnang Province, Mr. Dov Kimsing, Governor of Chulkiri District, youth group, officials of the Provincial Department of Agriculture and About 300 Fisheries Administration officials were invited to attend.
On that occasion, Mr. San Yu mentioned the importance of flooded forest, said that flooded forest plays an important role in fisheries, flooded forest is an important habitat, a source of food and a warm place for spawning. Of fish and other aquatic animals, which are fishery resources, because in the flooded forest there is a rich natural food that can supplement the biodiversity of the above fishery resources to grow more rapidly.
The Deputy Governor added that the flooded forest is also a storm barrier to protect the homes of fishermen or people who are floating villages, submerged villages or houses along the river and can also help fishermen to provide timber. Other for use as construction wood or as fishing equipment. In addition to the sacred role above, flooded forests also have many other significant benefits.
Finally, the Deputy Governor also instructed and instructed all people in Chon Kiri district, as well as people from abroad to work together to maintain, protect and conserve natural resources for our benefit. All together with our descendants as well.
