In July 2024, the branch executive officer led by Mr. Yan Udom, Deputy Director of the Cambodian Red Cross Branch, continued to open a training course on Cambodian Red Cross volunteer work and first aid training for CRC advisors and youths, Youth Scouts and Youth Scouts. Youth Council of Samlot High School, Samlot District, Battambang Province, a total of 101 people, 85 girls at Samlot High School.
