* First: History of the Red Cross Red Crescent and the history of the Cambodian Red Cross * Second: Cambodian Red Cross Youth Management and the Establishment of a Sustainable Youth Club * Third: Disaster Management and Climate Change * Fourth Road safety and health * Fifth: Participation in protecting children from online sexual exploitation in educational institutions * Sixth: First aid.
Mr. Yan Udom continued that although this course is only one day short, but provides a lot of knowledge and a solid foundation for the youth of the Cambodian Red Cross in order to promote the spirit of young people to be able to contribute. The Red Cross Red Crescent Movement alleviates the suffering of all affected people and to enhance the reputation of the Cambodian Red Cross, the only humanitarian association in Cambodia.
