The joint statement from the US NATO summit called China one of the key players behind Russia's war effort in Ukraine and even accused Beijing of continuing to pose systemic challenges for Europe and the Middle East. International security. China was quick to condemn the joint statement, saying it was biased, malicious and aimed at creating conflict.
China is Hungary's main investment and trade partner, while other countries in the European Union have been trying to reduce their economic dependence on Beijing. Earlier this week, Hungarian Prime Minister Viktor Orban met with Chinese President Xi Jinping to discuss peace efforts in Ukraine after visits to Kiev and Moscow.
Orban's talks with Russian President Vladimir Putin have angered some EU leaders as the bloc seeks to avoid high-level contacts with Moscow over the Ukraine war crisis. At the NATO summit in Washington, Western leaders pledged continued support for Ukraine, and the joint statement reaffirmed support for Ukraine on the path to future NATO membership.
Kampong Cham will officially end open defecation this July
(Kampong Cham): Mr. Yim Chung, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Rural Development, said that after the working group verified the situation of stopping open defecation in Kampong Cham province, which achieved good results, Kampong Cham will officially announce the end of open defecation on This coming July 25.
The Secretary of State said this on the occasion of presiding over the Reflection Workshop on the results of verifying the status of the completion of the field demolition on the morning of July 12, 2024 at Kampong Cham Provincial Hall.
The Secretary of State of the Ministry of Rural Development added that the national ODF verification team showed that the sanitation and environment in Kampong Cham was relatively good, especially through this verification, no backyard was found. Defecation continued in the open, even in some suspected places that used to be forest or on the river, by the lake, there is no evidence that there is defecation outside the toilet.
On the contrary, these suspicious areas have become homeless, tidy, scenic, beautiful, hygienic and environmentally friendly, which proves that Kampong Cham deserves the ODF award.
Mr. Han Kosal, Deputy Governor of Kampong Cham Province, stated that according to the results of the workshop, we have agreed and accepted the results of the verification by the national and partner organizations that decided to become Kampong Cham. The province has won the end of the outdoor defecation (ODF) and the project will be officially announced on July 25.
