After further questioning, the suspect confessed that his accomplices used to carry swords and knives on motorbikes in Svay Rieng City and had chased gangsters at Chi Phu Market several times.
After hearing the confessions of the three suspects, the Svay Chrum District Police Inspector reported to the Major General and asked for the opinion of Mr. Kham Sophary, Prosecutor of Svay Rieng Provincial Court, arrested the three suspects and arrested them. Evidence to build a case for legal action.
