Please listen to Mr. Soeung Sotheany's full statement below: Analysis: NATO that goes against the current trend will definitely fail.
On the surface, US efforts to establish "another NATO organization in the Asia-Pacific" have been ongoing, but in reality it has been difficult to form an alliance aimed at China in Asia, and even more so. The possibility of creating so-called new security protocols in the Asia-Pacific region.
First of all, most countries in the Asia-Pacific region do not accept and do not welcome. The United States considers NATO a strategic tool for defending its hegemony, but most countries in the Asia-Pacific region hate and oppose hegemony.
No matter how inflated NATO propaganda is, it cannot hide the fact that it itself is a source of threat to global stability. NATO's so-called Indo-Pacific strategy is just a plot Disintegration, conflict until war in order to serve the American hegemony. NATO, which goes against the current trend, will definitely fail.
