In July last year, more than a dozen people died in South Korea when a tunnel was flooded so fast that vehicles did not have enough time to leave. The East Asian country also suffered heavy rains and floods in 2022, killing more than 10 people. In the first six months of 2024, 115,838 vehicles were inspected.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Phorn Rim, Spokesman of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, said that as of June 2024, 115,838 vehicles were inspected for technical specifications, an increase of 41 vehicles. 548 units Compared to the same period in 2023, there were 74,290 vehicles to be repaired.
Mr. Phorn Rim said that all tuk-tuks and semi-trailers traveling on the road must have a vehicle technical inspection certificate issued by the Ministry of Public Works and Transport or a company authorized by the Ministry of Public Works and Transport. Certificates and vehicle technical inspection certificates for each vehicle type are valid as follows:
The spokesman further stated that the benefits of vehicle technical inspection include: providing safety to vehicle users, reducing congestion and accidents, contributing to the protection of road and bridge infrastructure, long-term vehicle profit. Less time and money to repair, protect the environment (follow the control measures on air pollution from vehicles).
In addition, for the implementation of the authorities on the road (traffic police) will inspect the vehicle does not have a vehicle inspection certificate, the authorities will also fine.
Ms. Im Rachana, Undersecretary of State and spokesperson for the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, told Fresh News on July 10, 2024 that the market that has absorbed the most fresh Cambodian exports is the national market. China after China allowed Cambodia to export fresh longan directly in 2022.
The momentum of Cambodia's longan exports to China has been steadily increasing, while Cambodian longan products will be allowed to enter the Alibaba market by the end of 2022.
Ms. Im Rachana also said that after the Ministry of Commerce signed a memorandum of understanding with Alibaba to sell fresh longan fruit in the online market, Alibaba has made Cambodia's fresh longan market even bigger, not just to you. Directly ordered in China, but also to customers who order from mobile phones to eat at home by pressing the order on the mobile phone.
She said that this is a good sign and the Ministry will continue to work with farmers and other stakeholders, especially with the Ministry of Commerce to find more markets.
She added that through the single-member welfare system for the new mandate, the relevant ministries have begun to actively cooperate. In fact, the Ministry of Agriculture is the producer, while the Ministry of Commerce is seeking market access to promote Cambodia's agricultural products to a wider market in international markets, especially China.
Regarding the export of fresh longan, Mr. Chhim Vachira, Director of the Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries of Battambang Province, said that for the export of fresh longan of Battambang province, the situation is better, most of which is exported to China and Others are exported to Thailand, while prices are generally assessed for levels 1 to 4, between 3,000 riel and 3,800 riel.
