General Commission of National Police continues fire drills in private markets and urges increased fire duty to all enterprises, establishments and large buildings to have ownership
(Phnom Penh): The Fire Prevention and Rescue Police Department of the National Police General Commission this morning, July 10, 2024, continued the firefighting, rescue and evacuation exercises at Aeon Mall 1 to strengthen the morale of all staff. Adequate ownership and a clear understanding of preventive and first aid measures in the event of an incident.
Lt. Gen. Neth Vantha, Director of the Fire Prevention and Rescue Police Department, said that the firefighting exercise with Aeon Mall 1 has been carried out for the past nine years, in order to integrate the primary fire prevention measures, Extinguish the fire using tools and evacuation when the fire situation occurs and can not be controlled.
The director of the department added that the fire law requires the target owner to cooperate with professional officers, so he suggested that market owners, enterprises, establishments and large buildings should increase cooperation with law enforcement forces, especially fire prevention and extinguishing. Conduct joint exercises to increase awareness among staff and officers.
He expressed concern that while Cambodia is developing, the construction of high-rise buildings is increasing, but if the owners do not pay attention to cooperate with professional officials to raise awareness of how to build. Prevent and prevent When an incident occurs, it is difficult for professional officers to intervene.
Lt. Gen. Neth Vantha noted that all Aeon Mall branches are a model Japanese supermarket that always provides good cooperation with law enforcement, especially the Department of Fire Prevention and Rescue in joint exercises and outreach. To its employees at all 3 branches at once. He considers this a model that other site owners should follow.
At the same time, Mr. Chuor Sovannara, Safety Manager of Aeon Mall, stated that the reason why Aeon Mall is cooperating with the Department of Fire Prevention and Rescue at this time is to follow the instructions of the Ministry of Interior through the General Commission of the National Police. While the company also has the ownership to prevent disasters, especially fires, to increase customer confidence.
