Master Plan to Develop Sihanoukville into a Multi-Purpose Special Economic Zone as a Compass for Developing Sihanoukville into a Major Economic Pole
At the same time, this "master plan" has a long-term vision to develop Sihanoukville into:
First, Cambodia's international gateway, becoming a multimodal transport and logistics hub, a business center and an international financial center,
Second, the National Development Paul, becoming a global destination for coastal and archipelago tourism, the National Center for Industrial Development and the National Center for Technology Innovation and Development.
Third, a big city in ASEAN with the reputation of being a green, sustainable, multicultural and intelligent model city.
To achieve this vision, the "Master Plan for the Development of Sihanoukville into a Multi-Purpose Special Economic Zone" will be implemented in two phases:
* Phase 1 "2025-2028": Focus on the integration of Sihanoukville into the regional trading system, expansion of logistics and tourism, as well as the improvement of the old city and the development of new areas, including the attraction High value-added investment.
Phase 2 "2029-2038": Sihanoukville will strengthen its role as a national gateway and a regional hub in the areas of finance, trade, industrial development, transportation and technology, as well as developing itself into a multi-city Functions for green and smart city ventures, as well as high-income, prosperous provinces.
As a result, the meeting commended and appreciated the preparation of the draft "Master Plan for the Development of Sihanoukville into a Multi-Purpose Special Economic Zone" and "Action Plan". At the same time, the meeting discussed some important points and asked the working group to further examine the use of words in some parts of the document to be consistent.
