Minister Neth Pheaktra informed that the overall development process of the media in Cambodia is very progressive, especially on social media, which has a lot of posting and broadcasting information, both real and fake news, and there are MMO groups to cut other voices. To confuse the public and the fact that the group does this to get more shares, money and other benefits.
Therefore, the Ministry of Information in the seventh mandate has been working to focus on improving the quality of the press by training human resources in the field of information as a whole so that the production of information content provides benefits and benefits to the people. Read and listen, including information security refers to the right to information, quality articles and safe to use information means no fake information.
