Kambol District Authority Holds a Meeting to Strengthen Local Implementation Measures, Crack Down on Gangs and Gambling
(Phnom Penh): Khan Kambol Unity Command held a meeting on the morning of July 8, 2024 in the hall of Khan Kambol, Phnom Penh to strengthen the implementation of local measures. These include cracking down on gangs, gambling of all kinds, epidemics, disasters, law enforcement, including the elimination of immorality and violence, as well as sanitation.
The meeting was chaired by Mr. Khim Sunsoda, Governor of Kambol District, and was attended by the Deputy Governor, the District Police Inspector, and the District Gendarmerie Commander. Mr. and Mrs. 7 Sangkat Chiefs, 7 Administrative Police Chiefs and 93 Village Chiefs.
On that occasion, Mr. Khim Sun Soda addressed the whole meeting on the issues that need to be implemented and strengthened in 7 important points, including: The problem of cracking down on gangs, which is a hot issue and the principle that the Prince The Prime Minister put out.
He called for the strengthening and increase of patrols, and if there is a gathering in a suspicious place, interrogate him, and if he is a student, he must ask which school he is from and take him to that school. Meet with the teacher to find out if you escaped from school or not.
Second: Gambling problems of all kinds must be eliminated together, including cards, sponges, lottery numbers, cockfighting arenas and so on. If there is a game in a cafe or a football table, please the village chief, commune chief and police chief to crack down, or if not possible, please report to the district or district inspectorate immediately to crack down and shut down.
The district governor added that, in particular, Chinese casino games, most of which are located in the New World City, and if found, call the landlord who rented to China to make a record to close immediately, and if stubborn refuses to close. Build a case to send to court.
At the same time, we ask all village chiefs, commune chiefs and post chiefs to further strengthen thefts, robberies, especially drugs in their localities through patrols, and if they can be cracked down, they must be cracked down, but if not, they should be cracked down on. Report immediately.
The district governor continued that, thirdly, the issue of public order, Sangkat and Post must help each other, help to prepare well and see if the tax collection is correct and not to have to collect tax from the vendors through the basket. Instead, help prepare a place for him to sell well and in an orderly manner, and the above seven districts must be constantly strengthened.
Fourth, the issue of elimination of obscenities and violence, the village chief and the commune chief, as well as the police station, must guide their citizens to understand, especially the workers who come to work in their local.
The district governor said that the fifth point, the issue of safe villages and communes and the resolution of disputes outside the court system, and he confirmed that in 5 years, there are 700 cases to be resolved and to date, the district has. More than 600 cases have been resolved outside the court system, and only 80 cases are still being resolved.
Sixth, the problem of garbage collection, which before there was never a car to collect in front of people's houses far away, but now under the arrangement by the Governor of Phnom Penh. In addition, the village chief and commune chief in places where there are a lot of people visit and explain to them to keep the garbage properly.
