Key Remarks by Samdech Mani Hun Manet on the Opening Ceremony of the 2nd Cambodia-France Business Forum
The following are the main contents of Samdech Mani Hun Manet's opportunity to open the 2nd Cambodia-France Business Forum:
* President Hun Manet stated that the first Franco-Cambodian Business Forum was launched in Paris during his official visit to the French Republic last January, which was an important first step in organizing the business forum. Second time today
* President Hun Manet hopes that Cambodia and France will continue to hold business forums to deepen relations among the business community and create mutually beneficial opportunities for future generations.
* President Hun Manet expressed confidence that French businessmen will be able to see the wide range of opportunities in the field of business and investment in Cambodia.
* President Hun Manet stated that the cooperation between Cambodia and France extends beyond politics and development assistance.
* President Hun Manet stated that France remains one of the largest trade and investment partners in Cambodia among European countries.
* President Hun Manet stated that Cambodia-France bilateral trade has increased steadily, amounting to 515.21 million US dollars in 2023 and 206.41 million US dollars in the first five months of 2024.
* President Hun Manet stated that French investment contributes to job creation, skills transfer and infrastructure development, which form the basis for sustainable economic growth in Cambodia.
* President Hun Manet stated that despite the difficult situation of the world, the Cambodian economy is still resilient, achieving a growth rate of about 5% in 2023 with a forecast of 6% economic growth in 2024.
* President Hun Manet stated that this strong and resilient economic trajectory has made Cambodia one of the prominent investment destinations in the emerging markets of Southeast Asia.
* President Hun Manet stated that in the last decade, Cambodia has always been among the least developed countries that receive the most foreign direct investment.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that in 2023, the Council for the Development of Cambodia has approved 268 investment projects worth nearly 4.9 billion US dollars.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that in the first half of 2024, Cambodia achieved the momentum of foreign direct investment flow, with the Council for the Development of Cambodia approved a total of 190 investment projects worth 3.2 billion US dollars. 3 times compared to the same period in 2023.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government has always adhered to the business support approach by providing support and assistance to the private sector at all stages of business operations.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that Cambodia has been implementing laws, policies and strategies from all angles to improve the business landscape and invest heavily in key infrastructure, access to regional markets, decent work, social protection, digitalization. , And environmental sustainability.
* President Hun Manet stated that foreign investors can create investment projects with 100% foreign ownership in most sectors without any conditions requiring the participation of local investors. The only exception is land ownership.
* Samdech Hun Sen Manet stated that the Royal Government of Cambodia always considers the well-being of all investors by paying close attention to the challenges raised by investors and constantly strengthening relations with the private sector to solve new problems. Effectively and effectively, adhering to the principle of "think together, act together and take responsibility together."
Samdech Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government has been continuously developing and implementing mechanisms that provide the most convenient means for the private sector to express their opinions, concerns, and suggestions. The most prominent mechanism is the Royal Government-Private Sector Forum.
* President Hun Manet invited all French investors to explore the huge investment potential, explore the rich opportunities and make strategic decisions to take advantage of the close bilateral relationship.
* President Hun Manet stated that Cambodia is ready to welcome and provide full support as well as hospitality to investors and business people.
Samdech Hun Sen welcomes the wise decision of all investors, especially French investors who choose and intend to invest in Cambodia directly or partner with local investors.
* President Hun Manet is optimistic that after this forum, Cambodia will receive a large amount of French investment and business, which broke previous years' record.
