The following is the message of Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum: Mr. Huot Hak chaired a meeting of the Party Committee of the Ministry of Inspection
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Huot Hak, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Party Committee of the Ministry of Inspection, on July 6, 2024, chaired a meeting of the Party Committee of the Ministry of Inspection with the participation of the Vice Chairman. A total of 62 party committee members, ministers and participants at the CPP headquarters (January 7).
In today's meeting, the President confirmed that this is the fourth meeting that the Party Committee of the Ministry has organized meetings and meetings in the past. He added that the meeting was held for two purposes:
First, monitor the progress of the work of the Ministry Party Committee, which has been achieved in the past 10 months.
Second, to elect additional members of the Standing Committee of the Party Committee of the Ministry and additional members of the Party Committee of the Ministry (the second time) in accordance with the spirit of the instruction of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party dated 21 June 2024 on the design Coalition, composition and number of party committee members, ministries, institutions.
After listening to the briefing on the progress of the work in the past, the President expressed his gratitude, appreciation and appreciation for the efforts of His Excellency, Lok Chumteav, leaders and party members at all levels and in all sectors who actively participated in Performing their respective roles responsibly has achieved remarkable results.
At the same time, the President assessed the results of the by-elections as smooth, free, fair, acceptable and based on the principles of democracy, and congratulated the candidates who won the election as members of the Standing Committee of the four party ministries. New and 12 new party committee members of the Ministry.
Taking this opportunity, the President informed the meeting to pay attention to some points to improve work efficiency:
1. To pay attention to the minds of the party members on a regular basis (cultivate patriotism and support the party relentlessly).
2. To pay more attention to the assignment and restructuring of the working group and the local party committee of the party branch under the party committee of the ministry when there is a restructuring of the new ministry.
3- Continue to promote unity, internal unity and good cooperation.
4-Develop a plan to train the capacity of party members in the Party committees, ministries and local levels and promote the sending of party officials to participate in various training courses to meet the actual needs and in line with the second priority of the Ministry is to strengthen human capital.
5- To strengthen the work system: have a clear action plan, assign implementation with a high sense of responsibility and have a regular monitoring and evaluation regime.
6. Leaders who are obliged to pay 5% contribution to the party must pay regularly to the party's central committee and pay contributions to the party committee of the ministry.
7. To promote and disseminate more widely to party members to use CoolApp, which is the work of Khmer children and in accordance with the high guidance of Samdech Techo, President of the Cambodian People's Party.
8- On August 5, 2024, on the occasion of the opening ceremony of Prek Chik Funan Techo: The Ministry will organize a drumming ceremony to celebrate and show the spirit of solidarity and support with the Royal Government. Therefore, all party members in the party base must be encouraged to participate in large numbers and disseminate widely.
The Chairman of the Party Committee of the Ministry of Inspection thanked all the leaders and members of our party for spending their physical and mental resources and efforts to fulfill the duties and responsibilities assigned by the party and the Royal Government.
