Major General Ong Sopheap, Ratanakkiri Provincial Police Commissioner, Kratie Provincial Police Commissioner, Stung Treng Provincial Police Commissioner and Mondulkiri Provincial Police Commissioner, and 63 lieutenant generals from the four provinces (female) 4 people).
The leadership skills training course for this Deputy Commissioner will last for 5 days from July 6, 2024 to July 10, 2024.
Lt. Gen. Tan Samnang said that the participants in this course were trainers from the Ministry of Interior with more than 40 years of experience. The Deputy General Commissioner recommended to the trainees who have attended the above refresher course to apply that knowledge directly to effectively serve their unit and the people better.
(Siem Reap): Duke Dr. Seang Nam, Member of the National Assembly, Member of the National Assembly of Siem Reap Province and Chairman of the Kralanh District Working Group, led the celebration of the 73rd anniversary of the founding of the Cambodian People's Party (June 28, 1951 - June 28, 2024). ) At the district party headquarters.
The ceremony took place on July 5, 2024, with a total of 450 leaders and party members in attendance.
On that occasion, Duke Seang Nam read out the speech of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Senate and President of the Cambodian People's Party and instructed the whole ceremony to understand the value of peace and keep it at any cost.
Duke Seang Nam recalled the history of the founding of the Cambodian People's Party on June 28, 2024, overcoming many major stages, including:
Duke Seang Nam brought the seven recommendations of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party:
1. In all circumstances and situations, leadership must be politically correct, both strategically and tactically. Therefore, we must stand on the ideals of patriotism combined with the path of multi-party liberal democracy to set out political programs, principles, policies and decisions.
2. The people are the deciding factor in a party's victory in all circumstances. Therefore, it is necessary to connect with the people, refer to the people to solve the people's requests and difficulties, and inspire the people to participate in the implementation of the party's political program.
3. Party officials at all levels, strong and clean, are the key to victory. Therefore, attention must be paid to the training and retraining of party officials in order to gain the love and support of the people.
4. The complete peace that we have established for more than 25 years has come with great difficulty. Therefore, we must be thankful for the peace, and we must work together to protect the peace so that it will always be strong. In this sense, let the whole people promote the spirit of nationalism and get rid of extremist politics from Cambodia. On the other hand, we must continue to push for reform, because reform is the driving force of development.
5. Party organizations at all levels, party officials, party members must strive to maintain strong internal unity within the party based on the basis of political programs, statutes, policies of the party.
6. Thank you for your full support of the Funan Techo Canal Development Project, which will greatly benefit Cambodia.
7. The Cambodian People's Party continues to promote the implementation of an independent foreign policy to protect all of Cambodia's core interests and increase participation in international affairs for the cause of peace, security, cooperation and prosperity of the region and the world.
