At present, China Road Bridge Corporation (CRBC) is the contractor, having prepared the location for office accommodation, warehouse and construction workshop. Meanwhile, CRBC is building a temporary port for transporting construction materials, which has reached 80% and has completed the access road to the site.
Drilling equipment and other machinery and construction materials ready for import from China may arrive in Cambodia soon to begin construction.
