At the same time, the people in Samprouch commune expressed their deep gratitude to the Governor of Stong District and the Director of the Kampong Thom Provincial Department of Agriculture, who always paid attention and facilitated the distribution of water to save his rice fields on this occasion. .
It should be noted that due to the slow arrival of the rainy season this year, the rainfall was not enough to irrigate farmers' paddy fields, and the amount of rice that needs to be rescued now is 1,200 hectares.
