I would like to share my deepest condolences and express my condolences to His Excellency the Honorary Doctor and Lok Chumteav, as well as all the family and relatives of the deceased. The death of His Excellency Hor Nambora is the loss of a virtuous son, husband and father, and the loss of one of the nation's best human resources who sacrificed their physical and mental strength to serve in many countries. And contribute to the service of the nation, religion and the King.
