The following is a presentation by the Ministry of Agriculture on the characteristics and management of white flies:
* First: Biological characteristics
White flies directly destroy rice plants by sucking on plants from rice leaves (very active in the morning), causing the leaves to turn yellow and shrink. It severely damages the rice crop during the growing and weeding stages, and the destruction of the white fly, which affects the economy of 30-40 people per clump, reduces the yield by 23-31% if the damage is within During the flowering stage, the yield loss is even greater.
* Third: How to check the presence of white flies on rice
* 4th: Measures to control and get rid of white flies
* Note: Must choose any pesticide that is properly registered.
