He said that this change is due to the change in the structure of the Cambodian economy to the actual situation of the economy, because some sectors have grown new, which must include these sectors to confirm the reality of the economic situation.
Mr. Tep Phiyorin, Undersecretary of State of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, stated that the change in the GDP year from 2000 to 2014 has increased the size of Cambodia's economy and made GDP for people. One is also larger. At the same time, the economic base of the new base year also makes GDP growth and growth in each sector and sub-sector change compared to the old base year.
